+  // Replaces the WindowDelegate after construction. The window's
+  // delegate_ is normally set only in the constructor's member
+  // initializer list; this method allows a platform layer that built
+  // the Window with delegate=nullptr (e.g. QNX's
+  // WindowTreeHostPlatform::Create path) to attach a delegate before
+  // dispatching events. Sets both delegate_ and the EventTarget
+  // target_handler_ so the Aura event flow (CanAcceptEvent -> OnEvent
+  // -> delegate) can reach the new handler. Idempotent for the same
+  // delegate pointer.
+  void SetDelegate(WindowDelegate* delegate);
